 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Program     : COACTUPC.PLI                                        */
 /* Application : CardDemo                                            */
 /* Type        : IMS PL/I Program                                    */
 /* Function    : Accept and process Account Update                   */
 /* Converted from COBOL/CICS: app/cbl/COACTUPC.cbl                  */
 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.                     */
